          "name": "Sec ② 漸層 Gradients",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ViRGa",
              "name": "SH",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ktcd3",
                  "name": "T",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "content": "② 漸層 Gradients — 三個，各有出處",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "U5fRGR",
                  "name": "S",
                  "fill": "#553040",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "規則：說不出物理出處的漸層不畫。禁止紫藍 hero 漸層、按鈕漸層、為了好看而加的漸層。壓在漸層上的文字一律以漸層最不利點量對比。三道漸層：① 窗光（實體定錨，全畫面共用同一盞光）② 印相罩（狀態列滿罩保證）③ 角托染料池（取代原本的置中暈影——見下）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "aiqkb",
