          "name": "Sec ④ 間距節奏 Spacing Rhythm",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": [
            44,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "PvpF9",
              "name": "SH",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "O3eM7",
                  "name": "T",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "content": "④ 間距節奏 Spacing Rhythm",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JkWvW",
                  "name": "S",
                  "fill": "#553040",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "一套節奏，四個鈕：【群內 8】標籤↔欄位、圖示↔標籤。【群間 16】同層項目。【段落 24】區塊之間。【章節 44】一個畫面的兩個章節之間——每一個畫面都必須出現一次，24 個畫面 24 次（8 次是真 gap，16 次是 padding）。輔助兩個：sp-tight 6（詞內光學）、sp-group 12（同一段文字內部）。\n\n【R3 刪 10】sp-inline 10 與 8／12 在畫面上不可分辨，20 個使用點已重新指派（圖示列→8、堆疊文字→12），token 已刪。\n\n【內縮節奏 padding】ctl-pad-nav 9／ctl-pad-tap 9.5／ctl-pad-md 15.5／ctl-pad-cta 17.5／inset-card 20／inset-mount 26／screen-pad 24／screen-pad-lg 40。控件高度一律由 padding 推導，不寫死——順帶讓 AX 字級自己長高。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
