                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "【R3 取代 R2 的「兩套節奏」】堆疊 gap 只剩一組階梯：6 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 44。內縮 padding 仍是獨立一組：ctl-pad-nav 9 / ctl-pad-tap 9.5 / ctl-pad-md 15.5 / ctl-pad-cta 17.5 / inset-card 20 / inset-mount 26 / screen-pad 24 / screen-pad-lg 40 / corner-out 5。兩組不互相借值是刻意的：一個管「東西之間」，一個管「東西裡面」。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
